                                "sense_id": "5cd2bc97-90ce-3fc4-b78a-3f502dd0e94d",
                                "text": "In zijn kersttoespraak wenste de koning zijn volk toe dat zij allen zullen branden in de hel.",
                                "translation": "In his Christmas speech the king expressed the wish to his people that they all will burn in hell.",
